  "solution": {
    "text": "According to Lewis concept \"Acids are electron acceptor and bases are electron donor\" Since, electron deficient compounds also have an ability to accept electrons, these are regarded as acids.<br />Trimethylborane \\((\\mathrm{CH})_3\\) B have incomplete octet thus, act as Lewis acid.<br /><img src=\"assets\\st0002_b01f3985cce1.png\">"
